:: StoryTitle
Recipe Expressions

:: StoryData
{
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.9",
  "start": "Meet Ana",
  "zoom": 1
}

:: Setup [startup] {"position":"25,25","size":"100,100"}
<!-- STEP 1: Ana starts neutral. -->
(set: $mood to "neutral")

:: Ana Picture [header] {"position":"25,150","size":"100,100"}
<!-- STEP 2: show the right picture for her mood. This is a header, so it's at the top of every passage. -->
(if: $mood is "happy")[<img class="char" src="https://spelafort.github.io/TwineFAQ/images/ana-happy.png">](else-if: $mood is "angry")[<img class="char" src="https://spelafort.github.io/TwineFAQ/images/ana-angry.png">](else:)[<img class="char" src="https://spelafort.github.io/TwineFAQ/images/ana-neutral.png">]

:: Meet Ana {"position":"150,25","size":"100,100"}
Ana looks up from her phone. "You're late."

<!-- STEP 3: change her mood when the player chooses. -->
(link: "Say sorry")[(set: $mood to "happy")(goto: "After")]
(link: "Say nothing")[(set: $mood to "angry")(goto: "After")]

:: After {"position":"275,25","size":"100,100"}
(if: $mood is "happy")["Thanks. Seriously."](else:)["Wow. OK."]

[[Start again->Reset]]

:: Reset {"position":"400,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $mood to "neutral")(goto: "Meet Ana")

:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
.char {
  display: block;
  height: 220px;      /* how tall the character is */
  margin: 0 auto;     /* centres the picture */
}
